<figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File"><a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:CC_some_rights_reserved_new.svg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/CC_some_rights_reserved_new.svg/120px-CC_some_rights_reserved_new.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="110" height="38" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/CC_some_rights_reserved_new.svg/250px-CC_some_rights_reserved_new.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="749" data-file-height="259"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File"><a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Autoportrait_Habib_Mhenni,_29_d%C3%A9cembre_2017,_DSC_7468.jpg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Autoportrait_Habib_Mhenni%2C_29_d%C3%A9cembre_2017%2C_DSC_7468.jpg/120px-Autoportrait_Habib_Mhenni%2C_29_d%C3%A9cembre_2017%2C_DSC_7468.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="110" height="110" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Autoportrait_Habib_Mhenni%2C_29_d%C3%A9cembre_2017%2C_DSC_7468.jpg/250px-Autoportrait_Habib_Mhenni%2C_29_d%C3%A9cembre_2017%2C_DSC_7468.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="1597" data-file-height="1598"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<figure class="mw-halign-right" typeof="mw:File"><a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dialog-information_on.svg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Dialog-information_on.svg/40px-Dialog-information_on.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="33" height="33" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Dialog-information_on.svg/120px-Dialog-information_on.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="48" data-file-height="48"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<p>Cette photographie est l'œuvre de <b><a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Dyolf77" title="User:Dyolf77">Habib Mhenni</a></b> (<b>User:Dyolf77</b>). Elle a été placée sous la ou les licence(s) spécifiée(s) ci-dessus. Vous êtes libre d'utiliser cette photo sous réserve de me mentionner et de respecter les termes de la licence.
</p>
<div class="center"><big>
<div class="multilingual"><div class="description en lang-en" lang="en" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-en" lang="en" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>English</bdi>: </span> Credits to <b>Habib Mhenni</b> / Wikimedia Commons</div><div class="description fr lang-fr" lang="fr" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-fr" lang="fr" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Français</bdi> : </span> Crédits à <b>Habib Mhenni</b> / Wikimedia Commons</div><div class="description ar lang-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ar" lang="ar" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>العربية</bdi>&nbsp;: </span> بترخيص <b>الحبيب مهني </b>/ ويكيميديا كومنز</div></div>
</big></div>
<p>Si vous utilisez cette photographie en dehors des projets de Wikimédia,<br> j'aimerais bien être <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:EmailUser/Dyolf77" title="Special:EmailUser/Dyolf77">informé</a> par (&nbsp;<span typeof="mw:File"><a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nuvola_apps_email.png" class="mw-file-description" title="courriel"><img alt="courriel" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Nuvola_apps_email.png/20px-Nuvola_apps_email.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Nuvola_apps_email.png/40px-Nuvola_apps_email.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128"></a></span>&nbsp;habib.mhenni&nbsp;<span class="nowrap"><span class="skin-invert" typeof="mw:File"><span title="@"><img alt="@" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/At_sign.svg/20px-At_sign.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="15" height="15" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/At_sign.svg/40px-At_sign.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="145" data-file-height="145"></span></span></span>&nbsp;gmail.com&nbsp;). Merci&nbsp;!<br>
Note&nbsp;: <span typeof="mw:File"><a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:No_Facebook.svg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/No_Facebook.svg/120px-No_Facebook.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="70" height="15" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/No_Facebook.svg/250px-No_Facebook.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="14"></a></span> Ce fichier a été publié sous une licence qui est incompatible avec les termes de licence de Facebook. Il est interdit de téléverser ce fichier sur Facebook.
</p>
